<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="829e1a6b">&lt;p&gt;
    This work product documents information about stakeholder groups.  It collects and displays how they are segmented
    (geographically and functionally), their attributes; their reporting relationships, level of commitment, influence on
    the change initiative, etc.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="44a6f456"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="6bfe2d22">Throughout the project, changes may occur and therefore, periodically review and update the stakeholder analysis as
required.</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="54d9bbb"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="bf0f75ed">To serve as a basis for making decisions about how to develop and prioritize stakeholder events, manage stakeholder and
sponsor relationships, set up networks, communicate and gather feedback.</attribute>
